th ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-25T14:12:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Why UTEP-NIU is 2026's most unglamorous Game of the Century","description":"The Week 13 game will mark the first time since at least 2000 that two teams that are winless against FBS opponents will meet in their final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T01:19:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50587546/utep-niu-college-football-game-century","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4867887/terrance-carter-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr."},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Terrance Carter Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr.","description":"American football tight end","touched":"2026-11-22T04:17:57Z","intro":"Terrance Carter Jr. is an American college football tight end for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Carter Jr. attended Harker Heights High School in Harker Heights, Texas, and committed to play college football for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns over Arkansas State."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"LOUISIANA\nAs a freshman in 2022, Carter Jr. took a redshirt. In 2023, he hauled in 28 receptions for 255 yards and three touchdowns. In week 8 of the 2024 season, Carter Jr. made seven catches for 149 yards and a touchdown in a 34-24 victory over Coastal Carolina. During the 2024 season, he recorded 48 catches for 689 yards and four touchdowns. After the 2024 season, Carter Jr. entered his name into the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS TECH\nCarter Jr. transferred to play for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He is expected to be the Red Raider's starting tight end."}]}}